Retyped the shared start/end/duration helpers in :mod:`icalendar.attr` to accept ``HasStartEndDuration`` instead of ``Component``, so type checkers require the ``_get_start_end_duration``, ``start``, ``end``, ``duration``, ``DTSTART`` and ``DURATION`` members only ``Event`` and ``Todo`` provide. Runtime behavior is unchanged. Drafted with Claude Sonnet 5, reviewed by me. @SemTiOne
